/design

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- design handoff
#
# The source design project (~5.7 MB of prototypes, registries and duplicated
# photos). Its job ended when the content reached Supabase, which is now the
# source of truth.
#
# Nothing in the build ever read it — tsconfig excludes it, ESLint ignores it,
# and app/ and src/ never import from it. Only `scripts/registry.ts` did, for
# seeding, and those loaders now fall back to `src/data/registry-snapshot.json`
# when the folder is absent. That fallback is verified, not assumed: with the
# handoff removed, `db:seed` rebuilds the database and `db:verify` still
# deep-equals it against the original registries.
#
# Keep a copy outside the repo. One guarantee weakens without it — `verify:mapping`
# drops from "proves fidelity to the signed-off design" to "proves the row mapping
# round-trips" — and the .dc.html prototypes are the stated pixel reference if a
# layout decision is ever questioned.
/arasya-handoff
